ch03/58-df-graph\">../batch03/58-df-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIndependentSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIndependentSet}_S\\)</span> (independent-set predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}independent\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIndependentSet}_S(I,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V,E\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\nI\\subseteq V\\land[I]^2\\cap E=\\emptyset\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}independent\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphIndependentSet}_S(I,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V,E\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\nI\\subseteq V\\land[I]^2\\cap E=\\emptyset\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in V","display":